    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac, agent ID 301. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689823266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something. Order number is 788-125B.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40896,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689828799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment while I pull that up for you... I see an order for a VeloFit Apex helmet. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689832533332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40896,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689839866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly. To get started, can you tell me what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689840566665
    },
    {
      "text": "I just don't like the color.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40896,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689850033331
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. I just need to confirm for our records, there are no issues with the helmet's fit or any of its safety features, correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689852099997
    },
    {
      "text": "I wouldn't know. The box is still unopened. I just want to send it back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40896,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689861299997
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for clarifying. I see here that the item was delivered 69 days ago. Let me just confirm our policy.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689866299997
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40896,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689873766663
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, you're all set. Our policy allows for returns on standard items up to 90 days after delivery, so you're well within that timeframe. I can go ahead and process this return for you immediately.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689874466663
    },
    {
