      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40896,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689887799996
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I've just emailed a pre-paid return label to the address on file. You can just print that out, attach it to the original box, and drop it off at your convenience.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689890733329
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. And the refund?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40896,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689902533329
    },
    {
      "text": "Once our warehouse receives the helmet, your full refund will be processed back to the original form of payment within 5 to 7 business days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766689904399995
    },
    {
